OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's security
OL,4,Aarrangements a private matter, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity arrangements for the Duke and
OL,7,FDuchess of Sussex on their return to
OL,8,Fthe UK are a "private matter", Prime
OL,9,FMinister Andy Burnham has said.
OL,11,FHe added: "It's a matter for Harry and
OL,12,Ffor Meghan, and we wish them well in
OL,13,Fthe move that they are making."
OL,15,FIt comes after it emerged that the
OL,16,Fcouple intend to relocate with their
OL,17,Fchildren from the US to the UK later
OL,18,Fthis month to a private, non-royal
OL,19,Fresidence outside London.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
