OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's security
OL,4,Aarrangements a private matter, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said decisions on the
OL,7,Fsecurity of royals were taken by the
OL,8,FRoyal and VIP Executive Committee
OL,9,F(Ravec).
